    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Three entry-tier data points at the $7-$16 monthly band — benchmarked against <a href="https://my.racknerd.com/aff.php?aff=16299" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">RackNerd</a> and Vultr — since that's where LightNode competes for monthly-bill, no-lock-in buyers:
    </p>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto my-6">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead><tr class="border-b border-gray-800 text-gray-400"><th class="text-left py-3">Provider</th><th class="text-left py-3">vCPU</th><th class="text-left py-3">RAM</th><th class="text-left py-3">NVMe</th><th class="text-left py-3">Bandwidth</th><th class="text-left py-3">Billing</th><th class="text-left py-3">Regions</th><th class="text-left py-3">Monthly</th></tr></thead>
